{"sections":[{"slug":"Atiyah–Hirzebruch谱序列","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Atiyah–Hirzebruch谱序列"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Atiyah–Hirzebruch <span lang=\"zh\">谱序列</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Atiyah–Hirzebruch 谱序列”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Atiyah–Hirzebruch <span lang=\"zh\">谱序列是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Serre谱序列","text":"Serre <span lang=\"zh\">谱序列</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维列</span>"}},{"Plain":" $F \\to P \\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及广义上同调理论</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">有谱序列</span>\n$$\r\nH^*(X,E^*(F)) \\Rightarrow E^*(P).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">一个常用的特例是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $F=\\mathrm {pt}$ <span lang=\"zh\">时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">该谱序列化为</span>\n$$\r\nH^*(X,E^*)\\Rightarrow E^*(X),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">即用</span> $E^*(\\mathrm {pt})$-<span lang=\"zh\">系数普通上同调计算</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">表示的广义上同调</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}